{"meta":{"id":"tt32268992","type":"movie","name":"Sacrificio: Los elegidos","imdb_id":"tt32268992","description":"Durante una gala benéfica repleta de estrellas —entre ellas celebridades, multimillonarios y discursos vacíos—, una estrella de cine inmersa en una crisis existencial es tomada como rehén por una guerrera radical y sus fieles seguidores. A medida que la noche se precipita hacia el caos, se desarrollan simultáneamente un viaje interior y una aventura externa, donde la línea que separa la representación de la creencia, y la salvación del sacrificio, comienza a desdibujarse.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt32268992.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uBRVzvMlNlKsegUCDXIwP7W6Ygb.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tGeQHqEFhrgRfFXooCT7vSA7IFb.png","genres":["Aventura","Comedia","Acción"],"releaseInfo":"2026","released":"2026-04-09T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"103 min","imdbRating":"5.0","country":"France, Greece, Cyprus, United Kingdom","cast":["Chris Evans","Anya Taylor-Joy","Vincent Cassel","Salma Hayek Pinault","John Malkovich","Charli xcx","Sam Richardson","Zarene Dallas","Yung Lean","Jade Croot","Miriam Silverman","Jeremy O. Harris","Tarek Haddaji","Dali Benssalah","Sami Slimane","Ouassini Embarek","Nefeli Kalantzi","Anton Trendafilov","Σοφία Πριόβολου","Spyros Ntantanidis","Ambika Mod","Marios Poimenidis","Γεράσιμος Σκιαδαρέσης","Loukianos Lyritsas","Chris Kourtellas","Phoebe Greenwood","Bebe Massey","Velimir Netsov","Diamantis Anastasiadis","Κωνσταντίνος Σειραδάκης"],"director":["Romain Gavras"],"writer":["Will Arbery","Romain Gavras"],"trailers":[{"source":"-Oi37LXE4GU","type":"Trailer","name":"SACRIFICIO LOS ELEGIDOS | TRAILER OFICIAL","ytId":"-Oi37LXE4GU","lang":"es"},{"source":"u5qW1gMMSVI","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer","ytId":"u5qW1gMMSVI","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"-Oi37LXE4GU","title":"SACRIFICIO LOS ELEGIDOS | TRAILER